WEBVTT

NOTE
Irvine Kinneas's introduction at Galbadia Garden.
Irvine is a sharpshooter who joins the party here before the Deling City parade mission.
Duration: approximately 28 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Copper curved railings blur against a bright blue sky.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A butterfly lands on Irvine's outstretched finger. Copper railings frame the blue sky above.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The Garden grounds in daytime; figures move in the background.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Irvine in his cowboy hat lies in the grass by the Garden exterior, relaxed.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Irvine crouches and reaches toward the ground.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The Galbadia Garden exterior with teal-lit architecture.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A figure in a wide-brim hat holds a rifle, glancing sidelong.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Close-up of the weapon and the character's hands.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The scene fades on the Galbadia Garden grounds.
